<title>UK: CSFB leads 100 mln mark Ecuador-linked bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB leads 100 mln mark Ecuador-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ECUADOR SYTHETIC SOVEREIGN INVESTMENTS JERSEY LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *13.0     MATURITY   *16.MAR.15</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-DOWN     ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  LISTING    LUX	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.25	SELL CONC  1.25	GOV L AW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO MARCH 2001, THEN STEPS-DOWN TO 10.25 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		 CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 AMORTISES IN FIVE EQUAL INSTALLMENTS BEGINNING 2011</p>
<p>		 UNDERLYING ARE PDI DUE 2015</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
